## The game's pixel font: "Cagebook", the font made for CAGE BOSS (CC0), brought over and updated.
## Two faces, drawn rect by rect so text stays crisp at any scale:
## - small (3x5 caps, proportional: M, N and W get the width they need to read), for scale 1;
## - main (5x7 caps), for anything drawn at scale 2 or more, at the size closest to what that scale
##   always was, a size down if it would come out wider, and centred in the old box, so no layout
##   moves.
## Everything's drawn in capitals, like the rest of the game. Characters neither face has fall back
## to the old 3x5 font.
class_name PixelFont
extends RefCounted

const SPACE_SMALL := 2
const SPACE_MAIN := 3

